<glyph name="M" format="2">
  <advance width="1020"/>
  <unicode hex="004D"/>
  <note>
Upright capital with lightly flared shoulders and a cupped, not needle-pointed, valley.
Weight master: 正文半粗：调制指数降到 0.74，不再跟着 Regular 的粗细差走。接合与竖茎持平，开始给内白让路。B 腰明确内收，e 的开口被额外撑开，8 的下眼大于上眼。
</note>
